title: "SIMPLE-Cacao-WA"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/LuisaStu/Cocoa_and_climate_change"
authors:
  - name: "SIMPLE-Cacao-WA contributors"
abstract: "Reproducible workflow applying published-parameter SIMPLE-Cacao to estimate relative cohort biomass responses to temperature and shortwave radiation in Ghana and Cote d'Ivoire. The study uses gridded inputs and published parameters, with farm-level calibration and validation outside its scope."
